{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:16 2026-05-16 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:16 2026-05-16 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:16 2026-05-16 HKT</p><p>今(16日)早上8時50分，一部5號線（由富山邨來往尖沙咀碼頭）九巴，駛至香港科學館站頭，一名7旬老翁上車，巴士隨後開行約100米，老翁正步往關愛座位期間，突然向前仆倒，昏迷不醒，車長將車停在漆咸道南125號對開，報警求助。救護員到場將老翁送往伊利沙伯醫院，惜經搶救後不治。</p><img alt=\"巴士停在漆咸道南125號天主教玫瑰堂對開。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2f00e54e021b60dc057d3e298416d7a6/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260516_094611546.jpg\"/><img alt=\"警員登上巴士調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/74e6a7f3c87f521e930f6765e7364637/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260516_094611546_03.jpg\"/><img alt=\"老翁當時步往右邊前排關愛座。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0570dac38bf9bde1dd16cb70d298714b/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260516_094611546_05.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/81324f5b021dba2e18c3c705bb7cc658/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260516_094611546_06.jpg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/188b82bae04c9d9ae8be1be86fc97f84/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260516_095558099_04.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/13419ac176389faedb54dc8b897faccf/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260516_095558099_06.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/dae2db579af6060dc4a3f284d6c8d42e/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260516_095831911.jpg\"/><img alt=\"車廂遺下一灘鮮血。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8ad1bac159fe6dd125353118d6878462/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260516_095831911_01.jpg\"/><img alt=\"車長協查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2f403147d53605c00046d42645b0cff7/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260516_095941089.jpg\"/><p>據巴士上乘客表示，當時巴士正常車速，惟老翁突向前仆，車廂內遺下一灘鮮血，警方正調查事件。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-16T04:10:56.349614+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":265,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}